<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνσκευ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>get ready, prepare,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					1096
				</span></i>
			; <i>harness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					7.21.6
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>contrive,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.3.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dress in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱματίῳ τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lyc.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nec.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁτιή σε . . Ἡρακλέα ʼνεσκεύασα</span>
			<i>dressed</i> you <i>up</i> as Hercules, prob.l.in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				523
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>dress oneself up,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				384
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cri.</u>
				53d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλικῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phryn.Com.
					2
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <i>arm oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.5.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππεῖς -σάμενοι τοὺς ἵππους</span>
			<i>having put trappings on their</i> horses, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.76d
			</span></i>:—but 
				Med.
			 just like
			
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				37
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be equipped,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνεσκεύαστο γὰρ οὕτως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναξυρίσι καὶ χειρῖσιν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Oth.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς εἰκόνα τοῦ δημιουργοῦ, τοῦ
				ἡλίου,</span> Porph.ap <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.12
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωφροσύνην ἐνεσκευασμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.682
				</span></i>
			.</div>
